                <pb facs="0212" n="78" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg78"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 698.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hall to Mr.
                            Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Libertad, Salvador</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-08-17"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 17,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Government of Italy is now pressing a heavy claim against the Government of
                    Salvador, arising out of Zaldivar’s transactions. The Salvadorian Government
                    would be extremely grateful if you should offer your mediation to Italy.
                    Negotiations pending in Paris are likely to fail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                    >Hall.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
